{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-sage-of-military-science","title":"兵学的圣人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-sage-of-military-science","wordCount":1791,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment","wordCount":1743,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"综合评价\">综合评价</h1><p>本章在客观审视争议的基础上，对孙子做出全面的综合评价。一方面，充分肯定他作为&quot;兵圣&quot;的卓越贡献与深邃智慧；另一方面，也客观地正视围绕其生平与著作的学术争议，并强调其思想价值的恒定。两篇文档，分别呈现兵学的圣人，以及一个全面而辩证的评判。</p>\n"}